[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3053313366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108418#issuecomment-3053313366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108418","id":3053313366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61_d1W","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-09T16:38:36Z","updated_at":"2025-07-09T16:38:36Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3053313366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117225408","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108418#issuecomment-3117225408","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108418","id":3117225408,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65zRXA","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T10:26:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T10:26:15Z","body":"I've had reports from a client of ours that they've run into this new error a few times after updating from 4.4.1-stable to 4.5-beta3. It's unfortunately rare and random, but has so far happened when saving GDScript files in the built-in script editor.\r\n\r\nWhen looking at the code, it would seem to me like there's some potential for race conditions with how this `ScriptEditor::update_doc` method is used, as some of its usages follow this pattern of first calling `EditorHelp::add_doc` and then immediately calling `ScriptEditor::update_doc` right after, as seen here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/967e2d499acd7d03a3e69002d373880e43fe0e45/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L2246-L2250\r\n\r\nHowever, as of #95821 the `add_doc` part is no longer necessarily synchronous, so I'm guessing it's as simple as something being queued up in `EditorHelp::_docs_to_add` instead of being immediately added through `DocTools`, which causes it to emit this `Can't update documentation ...` error due to `!EditorHelp::has_doc(p_name)`.\r\n\r\nIt's not immediately clear to me what the fix would be, but I'm guessing it would need to involve some deferring of `ScriptEditor::update_doc`.\r\n\r\nCC @anvilfolk.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117225408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117231238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108418#issuecomment-3117231238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108418","id":3117231238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65zSyG","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T10:28:10Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T10:28:10Z","body":"> However, as of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/95821 the add_doc part is no longer necessarily synchronous, so I'm guessing it's as simple as something being queued up in EditorHelp::_docs_to_add instead of being immediately added through DocTool\r\n\r\nIf that was true, the error would be printed only once. I see it every time a script is saved.\r\nUnless the doc is removed before adding it again.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117231238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3117243885","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108418#issuecomment-3117243885","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108418","id":3117243885,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65zV3t","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T10:32:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T10:33:12Z","body":"> If that was true, the error would be printed only once.\r\n\r\nRight. From what I've had reported to me, that is how it's presented itself, but I guess there's something else going on then.\r\n\r\n> I see it every time a script is saved.\r\n\r\nAs in 100% repro rate? Is there an issue/MRP for it somewhere that I've missed?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url